      "id": 6072,
      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-13T16:30:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Feels awkward, having read the official announcement of arenson9 and Rabit becoming new forum moderators, which includes a call to welcome them, but since you can’t reply to posts in the Announcements thread, we can’t actually welcome them there.  And there it is again in the News, a call to welcome, but we can’t reply to that so the new moderators remain tragically unwelcomed.  And they’re digging right in, reorganizing the forum and presumably moderating the heck out of the forums as we speak, <span class=\"bbcode-i\">yet they remain unwelcomed!</span></p>\n<p>I can’t take it anymore.  Welcome, arenson9 and Rabit.  I’m sure you guys will be awesome forum moderators. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:54.454Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
