      "raw": "How can we welcome them when they've already been here for almost a year? I've only been here for two months. Welcoming them seems a little presumptuous.\n\nI'd like to [i]congratulate[/i] them, but I've been a moderator and I'm not sure that's appropriate either. :P\n\nAt any rate, thanks for agreeing to an otherwise thankless job, guys.",
