      "id": 34531,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-13T17:11:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks, folks - greatly appreciate it! Looking forward to helping out.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Vyolynce&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Vyolynce\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’d like to <span class=\"bbcode-i\">congratulate</span> them, but I’ve been a moderator and I’m not sure that’s appropriate either. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Heh, yeah, me too. :o I think it will help the game, the company, and the community, though, so I’m willing to do the job again. (This is a <span class=\"bbcode-i\">much</span> smaller community, right now, but it’d be nice to see it grow!)</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;flamethrower49&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"flamethrower49\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Were you behind the board reorganization?  It looks nice.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Glad you like it! Can’t say we were “behind” it, but we were involved in a conversation. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Rabit</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:08:28.494Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
