      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Thanks, folks - greatly appreciate it! Looking forward to helping out.\n\n\n[quote=\"\"Vyolynce\"\"]\n\nI'd like to [i]congratulate[/i] them, but I've been a moderator and I'm not sure that's appropriate either. :P\n\n[/quote]\n\n\nHeh, yeah, me too. :o I think it will help the game, the company, and the community, though, so I'm willing to do the job again. (This is a [i]much[/i] smaller community, right now, but it'd be nice to see it grow!)\n\n\n[quote=\"\"flamethrower49\"\"]\n\nWere you behind the board reorganization?  It looks nice.\n\n[/quote]\n\n\nGlad you like it! Can't say we were \"behind\" it, but we were involved in a conversation. :)\n\nRabit",
