      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-13T20:15:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks, guys. Our aim is to support the community, including helping everyone enjoy using the forum.</p>\n<p>I did suggest having an Events section (and credit to the person (kirioni) who suggested that to <em>me</em>), but the reorg is, as I see it, a nod to the fact that &gt;G is about more than just one game! Much for all of us to look forward to.</p>\n<p>ALSO, let’s take a moment to enjoy the fact that the main reason there are now moderators is that &gt;G has so much going on that they don’t have the <em>time</em> to moderate themselves anymore. That’s a <em>GOOD</em> thing.</p>",
      "post_number": 10,
